# OpenFang Android — GitHub Secrets (4 required)
#
# Before the first CI build, set these in your repo's Settings → Secrets:
#
#   APK_SIGNING_KEY      base64-encoded .jks keystore
#                        (generate with: keytool -genkeypair -alias openfang \
#                           -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 \
#                           -keystore keystore.jks -storepass <pw> -keypass <pw>)
#   KEY_ALIAS            e.g. "openfang"
#   KEY_STORE_PASSWORD   the -storepass from keytool
#   KEY_PASSWORD         the -keypass from keytool
#
# Without these, the workflow still builds the debug APK (unsigned) and
# uploads it as an artifact — but you'll want to sign for sideload.
